WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.334 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm so very happy
that you are here.

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:04.471
It's impossible for me to not
picture you as Princess Margaret

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:05.138 size:75% position:38% line:92%
in "The Crown," now.

00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:07.707
This is a role you almost did
not get though, is that correct?

00:00:07.707 --> 00:00:11.111 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, actually. I had quite
a strange screen test.

00:00:11.111 --> 00:00:12.712 align:start size:94% position:6%
I nearly -- nearly ruined it
for myself.

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:15.181
-You nearly blew it?
You're putting this on yourself?

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:16.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I nearly blew it.
-What'd you do?

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, it was my birthday.
-Okay.

00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:20.120
-And I was having birthday lunch
with my friends.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:22.689
I was going out in these, like,
quite bad dungarees.

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:24.391 align:start size:94% position:6%
Anyway, as I was walking
out of the house,

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:27.060 align:start size:94% position:6%
I did a double take in the
mirror and I thought,

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.328 line:92%
"Oh, my ankles looks so pale."

00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:29.629 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it was, like,
a summer's day.

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:32.465 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I sort of whacked on some,
like, instant, sort of,

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:35.201 align:start size:94% position:6%
fake tan I found
in my sister's drawer.

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:37.570
-This is because you didn't want
to have bad looking ankles

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.072 align:start size:94% position:6%
on your birthday?
-Yes. I mean, come on.

00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:40.407 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, okay.
We've all been there.

00:00:40.407 --> 00:00:41.941 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We've all been there.
-Yeah.

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:42.375 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:43.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You want to have birthday
ankles. It's your day.

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:44.978 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah.
-You know what I mean?

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:46.112 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Like, they've got to be

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:46.946 line:92%
sun-kissed for whatever reason.

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:49.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I, kind of, like,
slapped it on -- slapdash.

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:52.085
Very slapdash
and then went to my screen test

00:00:52.085 --> 00:00:56.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I borrowed some of mum's
ill-fitting skirts

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:58.625 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, like, pearls just to look
a little bit Margarety.

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:02.128
And I changed, and I just forgot
about the ankles.

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:02.662 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:03.997 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I walked into my screen
test,

00:01:03.997 --> 00:01:07.300
and, um, all four of the
directors and Peter Morgan,

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:09.235 size:81% position:41%
the creator, just went
straight to my ankles.

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:10.503 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because I was wearing
this skirt,

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:13.406 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they were looking at them
for about ten minutes

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:14.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
as I was trying to
get into character

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:16.609
and I was trying to be Margaret.
And then I looked down,

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:17.677 line:92%
and eventually Peter said,

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:20.180 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Look, what has happened
to your legs?"

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:23.083 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it was a fast-developing,
very strong, kind of,

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:24.784 size:75% position:38% line:92%
industrial fake tan.

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:25.318 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:27.153 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, they were like luminous
orange.

00:01:27.153 --> 00:01:30.824
-So you had, sort of, a regular
colored leg into the --

00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:31.825 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Very pale.
-Okay.

00:01:31.825 --> 00:01:33.960 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Into, like, what?
Did it look like a sock?

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.297 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, sort of,
fluorescent football sock.

00:01:37.297 --> 00:01:38.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-I'd say. Yeah.

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:40.700
-So, a very strange choice for
a member of the royal family.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:41.634 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you know what I mean?
-Yeah.

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:42.869 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, Peter said --
I mean, honestly,

00:01:42.869 --> 00:01:45.038 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think he looked at my ankles
more than my face

00:01:45.038 --> 00:01:45.705 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
for the whole hour.

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:47.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he said it nearly
cost me the job.

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:48.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow!
-Yeah.

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:50.009 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I'm glad you
persevered through that.

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:51.878 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I know. I pushed through.
-Yeah.

00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:54.280 align:start size:94% position:6%
The great actors always have
to handle

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:56.549 align:start size:94% position:6%
bad self-applied tanning
at some point.

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:57.117 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:58.718 align:start size:94% position:6%
-At some point, it happens.
Doesn't it?

00:01:58.718 --> 00:01:59.953 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It happens.
It happens to the best of it.

00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:01.888 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It happens to the best of us.
And that was an early --

00:02:01.888 --> 00:02:03.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
that -- I haven't used
fake tanner since.

00:02:03.056 --> 00:02:04.691 size:84% position:42%
-When he auditioned for
"There Will Be Blood,"

00:02:04.691 --> 00:02:06.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
Daniel Day-Lewis,
crazy-bad fake tan.

00:02:06.926 --> 00:02:08.528 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is that true?
-No.

00:02:08.528 --> 00:02:09.729 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:11.898 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, Seth, I'm incredibly
gullible.

00:02:11.898 --> 00:02:13.666 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Oh,
I'll keep that in mind

00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:15.802 align:start size:94% position:6%
and enjoy the rest of this
interview.

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:16.436 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.436 --> 00:02:20.473
So, you -- this is a --
because you play a royal,

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:22.308
and this time where people
are obsessed with royals

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:25.211 align:start size:94% position:6%
because of the wedding,
do people, sort of, assume

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:26.446 line:92%
that because you play one on TV,

00:02:26.446 --> 00:02:28.681
that you have extra intel
into the royal family?

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:30.717 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, all the time.
People are like.

00:02:30.717 --> 00:02:33.419
"so, how do you think Harry
feels with the roast chicken

00:02:33.419 --> 00:02:35.155 align:start size:94% position:6%
and Meghan?
How do you think he did it?"

00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:37.690
I'm like, "Well, I played
his great aunt in a show.

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:41.694 size:88% position:44%
I think -- I'm sure he's
overcome with emotion."

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:42.729 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the Queen,
I mean, all of them.

00:02:42.729 --> 00:02:45.565
-But you did -- you fell in love
with Princess Margaret, yes?

00:02:45.565 --> 00:02:46.866 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Quite right.
-You really did.

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:47.800 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Too obsessed.
-Too obsessed.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:52.172
You so obsessed that you --
you framed a picture of her

00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:54.440 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the Queen and put it
in your bathroom.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:55.308 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.308 --> 00:02:57.677 size:88% position:44%
So, now people who go in
this bathroom know that

00:02:57.677 --> 00:02:59.479 align:start size:94% position:6%
that's someone you play
on a TV show.

00:02:59.479 --> 00:03:01.581 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I know. Most people don't,
I don't think.

00:03:01.581 --> 00:03:02.882 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh.
-And they just think I'm

00:03:02.882 --> 00:03:04.851 align:start size:94% position:6%
just obsessed with the Queen
on horseback

00:03:04.851 --> 00:03:06.085
on the front cover of "Tatler."
-Yeah.

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:08.588
-The thing is, is what happened
was I got so nervous

00:03:08.588 --> 00:03:10.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
before playing her,
I just was like,

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:11.858 size:78% position:39%
I need to order every
picture I could find.

00:03:11.858 --> 00:03:13.760 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, like,
put it all over my house,

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:15.995
and then somehow when I wake up
or when I wee --

00:03:15.995 --> 00:03:18.731 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know what I mean?
Like absorb her personality.

00:03:18.731 --> 00:03:20.934 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, wow.
-Gradually by osmosis.

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:23.136 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, so you don't want to lose
a single moment.

00:03:23.136 --> 00:03:23.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No.
-Yeah.

00:03:23.937 --> 00:03:25.605
-And why?
I mean, they both look dreadful.

00:03:25.605 --> 00:03:26.439 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Sorry Queenie,

00:03:26.439 --> 00:03:28.508
but you don't look great.
-I do have a question.

00:03:28.508 --> 00:03:30.510 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is this -- is this you
in the mirror?

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:33.279 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That was my mum.
-Oh, that's your mom trying --

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:33.780 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:35.014 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, she's
-That's my mum.

00:03:35.014 --> 00:03:35.682 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
She hates pictures.

00:03:35.682 --> 00:03:36.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, she's gonna be so
embarrassed.

00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:38.017 align:start size:94% position:6%
But look.
Like a creepy stalker.

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:39.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
-By the way no one's
going to be like,

00:03:39.385 --> 00:03:40.954 align:start size:94% position:6%
"That's a terrible picture
of your mom."

00:03:40.954 --> 00:03:42.288 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can't even tell it's her.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.288 --> 00:03:44.624 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Also, by the way, that was
the tea towel from my kitchen.

00:03:44.624 --> 00:03:46.292 align:start size:94% position:6%
She put it in to make the loo
look nicer.

00:03:46.292 --> 00:03:47.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, really?
-There's not usually

00:03:47.293 --> 00:03:48.561 align:start size:94% position:6%
anything there, yeah.
-Did you say,

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:49.662 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Hey, I need you to take
a picture

00:03:49.662 --> 00:03:51.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
of this for television?"
-I did, yeah.

00:03:51.164 --> 00:03:52.232 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then she said "Okay,
I'm gonna --

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:53.533 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm gonna spruce it up."
-She drove 'round --

00:03:53.533 --> 00:03:56.236 align:start size:94% position:6%
She drove 'round to my house
and took it.

00:03:56.236 --> 00:03:57.170 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Really?

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:59.973 size:75% position:38%
-She's like my life.
-Oh, that's great.

00:03:59.973 --> 00:04:03.009 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, it's -- she's obviously
not a professional.

00:04:03.009 --> 00:04:03.543 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:03.543 --> 00:04:05.845 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I think she did
a really good job.

00:04:05.845 --> 00:04:08.081
-That's, like, not even an eye.
Yeah.

00:04:08.081 --> 00:04:10.850 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, it's fantastic.
And obviously it's a place --

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.185 align:start size:94% position:6%
who wouldn't want
that as a bathroom?

00:04:12.185 --> 00:04:13.953
-You think so?
I think I need to take it down.

00:04:13.953 --> 00:04:15.688 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think you -- yeah,
you maybe need to, like --

00:04:15.688 --> 00:04:18.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
or put, like, something else
up to complement it.

00:04:18.591 --> 00:04:20.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What should I put?
-I don't know.

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:21.194 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Maybe I do.
-But maybe some --

00:04:21.194 --> 00:04:23.496 align:start size:94% position:6%
Definitely don't put someone
you've played on TV.

00:04:23.496 --> 00:04:24.564
-I know.
-Like, don't make that dramatic.

00:04:24.564 --> 00:04:27.200
-It's kind of cringe, isn't it?
I mean, she's all over my house.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like my DVD collection.
-Is it also --

00:04:29.002 --> 00:04:30.203 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause you live with
your sister?

00:04:30.203 --> 00:04:31.371 size:81% position:41%
-And my best friend.
-And your best friend.

00:04:31.371 --> 00:04:33.373 align:start size:94% position:6%
And do you also -- is it true
that you make them listen

00:04:33.373 --> 00:04:35.808
to music that Princess Margaret
listened to?

00:04:35.808 --> 00:04:38.011 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. I know, terrible.
-So, what did she listen to?

00:04:38.011 --> 00:04:39.746
-So, she has this desert island
disc on YouTube.

00:04:39.746 --> 00:04:42.448
I really recommend it.
I'm such a desperate fan.

00:04:42.448 --> 00:04:43.283 size:88% position:44% line:92%
It's quite embarrassing.

00:04:43.283 --> 00:04:43.783 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:43.783 --> 00:04:46.352 align:start size:94% position:6%
So she talks about
her favorite music.

00:04:46.352 --> 00:04:48.621
And one is "Scotland the Brave"
on the bagpipes.

00:04:48.621 --> 00:04:50.857
So I'd blast it out on a Sunday.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:50.857 --> 00:04:52.692 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was like rah,
rah, rah, rah, rah!

00:04:52.692 --> 00:04:53.393 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Like that, literally.

00:04:53.393 --> 00:04:55.194 align:start size:94% position:6%
And my sister is, like,
waking up to it at 9:00 a.m.,

00:04:55.194 --> 00:04:58.831
like, "Please, dear God. I hate
having an actress as a sister."

00:04:58.831 --> 00:05:00.833 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then, like,
none of them are actresses.

00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:03.369 align:start size:94% position:6%
But they put up with me.
And like, the DVD collection

00:05:03.369 --> 00:05:05.438 size:84% position:42%
is like "Royal Family,"
"The Royal Wedding,"

00:05:05.438 --> 00:05:06.406 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"The Queen at 50."

00:05:06.406 --> 00:05:08.541
You know, "Margaret and Peter."
It's just really --

00:05:08.541 --> 00:05:11.044 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's pathetic.
-And do you watch it a lot?

00:05:11.044 --> 00:05:13.046 align:start size:94% position:6%
-To reminisce and, like, cry
over it.

00:05:13.046 --> 00:05:13.579 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:13.579 --> 00:05:16.482 align:start size:94% position:6%
My sister.
-This is very exciting.

00:05:16.482 --> 00:05:18.785 size:75% position:38%
You are doing a show
in London right now.

00:05:18.785 --> 00:05:20.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Julia."
-"Julie."

00:05:20.353 --> 00:05:21.788 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Julie," sorry.
-No, no. It's okay.

00:05:21.788 --> 00:05:23.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I saw you in "Julia."
It was not as good,

00:05:23.222 --> 00:05:25.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I'm glad you've moved on
to "Julie."

00:05:25.758 --> 00:05:26.326 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:26.326 --> 00:05:28.394 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, I probably just --
but there was --

00:05:28.394 --> 00:05:29.529 line:92%
I always am fascinated by things

00:05:29.529 --> 00:05:32.165
