of the first previews.

00:05:38.671 --> 00:05:41.174 align:start size:94% position:6%
And someone in the circle --
or the balcony.

00:05:41.174 --> 00:05:44.477
At the end when everyone
was clapping, they had a fight,

00:05:44.477 --> 00:05:46.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
and a man tried to push
another man off it

00:05:46.879 --> 00:05:50.416
while they were clapping.
I was like, "Was it me?

00:05:50.416 --> 00:05:50.950 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:53.419 size:88% position:44%
Was it something I did?
Is it something I said?"

00:05:53.419 --> 00:05:55.154 align:start size:94% position:6%
Maybe they hated it.
But, yeah.

00:05:55.154 --> 00:05:55.855 line:92%
It was all over the news.

00:05:55.855 --> 00:05:57.023 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, it was, like,
during the applause?

00:05:57.023 --> 00:06:00.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
And nobody ever figured out
what the conflict was?

00:06:00.026 --> 00:06:02.095 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, it was just two guys.
-Wow.

00:06:02.095 --> 00:06:02.762 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Like a big bust up.

00:06:02.762 --> 00:06:05.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It doesn't seem like you
would go get wasted

00:06:05.164 --> 00:06:06.366 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
and go see "Julie."

00:06:06.366 --> 00:06:07.266 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-I know.

00:06:07.266 --> 00:06:10.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know. Maybe they were just,
like, glugging it down.

00:06:10.002 --> 00:06:11.537 align:start size:94% position:6%
glugging something down
during it.

00:06:11.537 --> 00:06:13.873 size:78% position:39%
Or maybe they just --
I just -- in fact,

00:06:13.873 --> 00:06:14.841 align:start size:94% position:6%
